  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Budget and Financial Accountability - The Gambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OTA advisor is expected to provide technical assistance the Ministry of Finance and Economic Affairs of The Gambia Directorate of Budget officials and to coordinate these efforts with the Director of Budget. The OTA Advisor intendeds to provide assistance to strengthen budget formulation, improve the application of the performance data contained in the program based budget, and formulate recommendations for the organizational structure and staffing profile for the Directorate of Budget</narrative>
  </description>
